---
---
<section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-[#e5dce7]" id="workflow">
<div class="max-w-2xl mb-10">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-[#4c1268]">End-to-End Execution</span>
</div>
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#231429] mb-3 tracking-tight">
          How orders move across the ecosystem
        </h2>
<p class="text-base text-[#594c5e]">Four connected roles move an order from checkout to delivery.</p>
</div>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">

<div class="bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#e5dce7] p-5 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#4c1268] bg-[#f1ebf3] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#e5dce7]">STAGE 01</span>
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
</div>
<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#231429] mb-2">Browse &amp; Order</h3>
<p class="text-xs text-[#594c5e] leading-relaxed">Browse products and shops, then choose the available checkout options.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-[#e5dce7] font-mono text-[11px] text-[#7d6f83]">
            Channel: aisley.app
          </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#e5dce7] p-5 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#4c1268] bg-[#f1ebf3] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#e5dce7]">STAGE 02</span>
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
</div>
<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#231429] mb-2">Seller Prepares</h3>
<p class="text-xs text-[#594c5e] leading-relaxed">Prepare the order, pack parcels, and print waybills.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-[#e5dce7] font-mono text-[11px] text-[#7d6f83]">
            Channel: seller.aisley.app
          </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#bfdbfe] p-5 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#2563eb] bg-[#eff6ff] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#bfdbfe]">STAGE 03</span>
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
</div>
<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#231429] mb-2">Logistics Coordinates</h3>
<p class="text-xs text-[#594c5e] leading-relaxed">Coordinate receiving, sorting, pickup, and dispatch.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-[#e5dce7] font-mono text-[11px] text-[#2563eb]">
            Channel: logistics.aisley.app
          </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#e5dce7] p-5 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#4c1268] bg-[#f1ebf3] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#e5dce7]">STAGE 04</span>
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
</div>
<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#231429] mb-2">Courier Delivers</h3>
<p class="text-xs text-[#594c5e] leading-relaxed">Use the Rider mobile app for pickup and delivery workflows.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-[#e5dce7] font-mono text-[11px] text-[#7d6f83]">
            Channel: Native Rider App
          </div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
